---
---
<section class="section-solutions-hero" id="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sh-wrapper">
      
      <!-- Text Area -->
      <div class="sh-content">
        <span class="weroast-badge-pill" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border-light); color: var(--text-muted); border-radius: 4px; font-family: monospace; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">
          Customized digital solutions
        </span>
        <h1 class="sh-title">
          Nu fiecare provocare necesită un software nou. Mai întâi este nevoie de o decizie clară.
        </h1>
        <p class="sh-lead">
          Munca manuală repetitivă, introducerea acelorași date de mai multe ori sau sistemele deconectate pot îngreuna activitatea. Cu toate acestea, dezvoltarea personalizată nu este automat cea mai bună alegere.
        </p>
        <p class="sh-body">
          Analizăm procesul actual și rezultatul dorit. Apoi clarificăm dacă soluția potrivită este un produs standard, o integrare, o automatizare, dezvoltare personalizată sau dacă există motive clare pentru a nu continua proiectul.
        </p>
        
        <div class="sh-action">
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn-sh-primary">Descrieți provocarea</a>
          <div class="sh-reassurance">
            <img src="/images/gabriel-antonio-pop.png" alt="Gabriel Pop" class="sh-avatar">
            <span>Gabriel Pop conduce personal proiectul. Echipa noastră coordonează sarcinile funcționale și tehnice agreate.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual Area -->
      <div class="sh-visual">
        <div class="decision-diagram">
          <div class="node-root">Provocare operațională</div>
          <div class="lines-split">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none">
              <path d="M50,0 C50,50 10,50 10,100" class="svg-line"></path>
              <path d="M50,0 C50,50 50,50 50,100" class="svg-line"></path>
              <path d="M50,0 C50,50 90,50 90,100" class="svg-line"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="nodes-row">
            <div class="node-branch">Produs Standard</div>
            <div class="node-branch">Integrare</div>
            <div class="node-branch node-custom">Dezvoltare Proprie</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-solutions-hero {
    padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 5rem);
    padding-bottom: 7rem;
    background: var(--bg-page);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .sh-wrapper {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .sh-content {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .sh-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .sh-lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sh-body {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .sh-action {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .btn-sh-primary {
    background: var(--brand-navy);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 1.1rem 2.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-sh-primary:hover {
    background: #0f1b30;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .sh-reassurance {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 450px;
  }

  .sh-avatar {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: grayscale(100%);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .sh-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  /* Subtle diagonal hash pattern for boutique look */
  .sh-visual::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    opacity: 0.3;
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, var(--border-subtle) 0, var(--border-subtle) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 10px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .decision-diagram {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .node-root {
    background: var(--brand-navy);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: -10px; /* pull down to line */
  }

  .lines-split {
    width: 100%;
    height: 120px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .lines-split svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .svg-line {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--brand-navy);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
  }

  .nodes-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: -10px;
  }

  .node-branch {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-align: center;
    flex: 1;
    margin: 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .node-custom {
    border-color: var(--brand-purple);
    color: var(--brand-purple);
    background: var(--brand-purple-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .sh-wrapper {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .nodes-row { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
    .lines-split { display: none; }
    .node-root { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  }
</style>
